    "text": "2. The Service Provider specified in Column (I) of the Schedule hereto who engages in the provision of aeronautical services in Aerodromes specified in Column (II) of that Schedule in terms of section 8 of the Civil Aviation Act, No. 14 of 2010 shall pay to the Director General of the Civil Aviation Authority the charge specified in Column (III) of that Schedule for the usage of such Aerodromes and the land appertaining to such Aerodrome.",
